{"title":"Waiting in the Wings","artist":"Tangled The Series","sourceId":"reference:oOnTcpSyFiBbal6uL4fz","sourceHash":"544f19b90b234e09f37ad9998ec1d6d5a82c6947b7523bf188778f85f8ddb773","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":17255972,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.79,"end":7.52,"text":"Guess we all are born with parts to play","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":7.52,"end":14.58,"text":"Some of us are stars, and some are just in the way","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":14.58,"end":17.93,"text":"I know I was meant for glory","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":17.93,"end":25.08,"text":"But that's never what my story brings","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":25.08,"end":28.25,"text":"And yet I keep on waiting","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":28.25,"end":34.83,"text":"When you have the passion and the drive","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":34.83,"end":41.47,"text":"You expect your moment center stage to arrive","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":41.47,"end":44.77,"text":"I show up with heart a blazing","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":44.77,"end":51.05,"text":"Ready to achieve amazing things","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":51.05,"end":54.36,"text":"But I'm left waiting in the wings","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":54.36,"end":57.76,"text":"I hear my cue","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":57.76,"end":60.75,"text":"And yet I'm kept there, waiting","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":60.75,"end":64.26,"text":"Know what to do","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":64.26,"end":67.22,"text":"And still I stand there, waiting","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":67.22,"end":76.99,"text":"It's always someone else who sings","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":76.99,"end":80.44,"text":"While I'm left waiting in the wings","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":80.44,"end":86.75,"text":"And so I keep on keeping on","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":86.75,"end":92.84,"text":"My chances come and then I blink and they're gone","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":92.84,"end":96.08,"text":"Always overlooked unfairly","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":96.08,"end":101.13,"text":"While pretending that it barely stings","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":101.13,"end":104.92,"text":"But it stings, yes it stings","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":104.92,"end":109.14,"text":"And I'll shed no tears","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":109.14,"end":112.1,"text":"I'll only keep on waiting","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":112.1,"end":115.47999999999999,"text":"If no one cheers","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":115.47999999999999,"end":118.57,"text":"Well, I can keep on waiting","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":118.57,"end":123.92,"text":"Who cares how loud","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":123.92,"end":128.93,"text":"The silence rings","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":128.93,"end":134.08,"text":"You'll find me waiting in the wings","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}